+---
+id: SPEC-0022
+slug: adrs-for-recent-specs
+schema: keel.spec/1
+status: approved
+scope:
+- .keel/store/decisions/ADR-0026-*.md
+- .keel/store/decisions/ADR-0027-*.md
+- .keel/store/decisions/ADR-0028-*.md
+- .keel/store/decisions/ADR-0000-index.md
+budget:
+  criteria: 6
